sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(227,242,253) Public Zone
    participant P as Pipeline or architect
  end
  box rgb(224,242,241) Host service
    participant R as REST layer
    participant B as BPMN reader, JDK StAX
    participant D as DefinitionService
  end
  box rgb(255,248,225) Host PostgreSQL
    participant DB as pre_definition, pre_definition_layout
  end
  P->>R: POST /definitions:import-bpmn, Idempotency-Key, body up to 1 MB
  Note over R,B: No transaction is open during parsing and conversion
  R->>B: read(stream), DTD and external entities disabled, depth and element limits
  alt DOCTYPE or external entity present
    B-->>R: 422 BPMN_UNSAFE_XML
  else element outside the subset
    B-->>R: 422 BPMN_UNSUPPORTED_ELEMENT with element, id and line
  else inside the subset
    B-->>D: definition JSON and diagram part from BPMNDI
    D->>D: schema, graph, step registry and guardrail checks, hash without diagram
    alt invalid
      D-->>R: 422 VALIDATION_FAILED with problems
    else valid
      rect rgb(255,248,225)
        Note over D,DB: TX1, sync: one draft and its first layout revision
        D->>DB: INSERT pre_definition status DRAFT, source BPMN
        D->>DB: INSERT pre_definition_layout revision 1
        D->>DB: COMMIT
      end
      R-->>P: 201, status DRAFT, definitionHash, warnings
    end
  end
